      "runs": 7,
      "events": 86,
      "description": "Default local event log of the operator console and the scripted CLI demo, 2026-10-26 (local time). Schema 1.0: written before the hash chain existed, so its records carry no prev_hash/hash and are not chain-verified or re-derived on replay. C01, C02 and C05 are scripted (fake model, SIMULATED proofs); C03 is live Meta with simulated memory and SIMULATED proofs; C04 is live Meta with the simulated memory backend offline; C06 and C07 are live Meta with Hyphae records that carried no proof artifacts (integrity unavailable). Labels C01-C07 are assigned by this archive."
    },
